# Tracer: finite-product pointwise evidence retains its local binder scope.
# Before (same source verified, but its selected proof dropped the binder env):
# forall S finite_set:
#     S $subset Z
#     =>:
#         finite_set_product(S, fn(x S) Z {x}) = finite_set_product(S, fn(x S) Z {x + 0})
# Now: set equality, parameter introduction and pointwise equality retain their evidence.
# Boundary: replacing x + 0 with x + 1 must still fail (Rust negative regression).
# Evidence: target/release/litex -lang en -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_strategy/finite_set_product_pointwise_scope.lit

forall S finite_set:
    S $subset Z
    =>:
        finite_set_product(S, fn(x S) Z {x}) = finite_set_product(S, fn(x S) Z {x + 0})
